## Description

Agents suck at making figures. They make things looks ugly and emphasize the wrong things.  We’ve made skills so your agents can create beautiful figures for your papers or visualizations while you are doing research.  GPT-5.6 Sol (Codex) w/o and with skills: https://t.co/UiRdrWhJM1

